[{"client_msg_id":"eac2f8cd-10cf-4090-b38b-51b338ff4b92","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"特に現代物だとわからんの多い…","ts":"1634793788.006200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R=+NM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87dcdb21-5d18-4e01-ad61-6cdccc486b47","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そういえば、先日こういうことを知った\n\u0026gt; J.S.バッハが作曲した「音楽の捧げもの」に含まれる「逆行カノン」は、各旋律が左右を行き違う様から「蟹行カノン（または「蟹のカノン」）」とも呼ばれている。","ts":"1634793037.005600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sVw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"701d0b35-4052-41e4-8c29-c3d4d688c419","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"クラシックなんか聴いたことあるけど、タイトルも奏者もわからんのありがち……。","ts":"1634792427.005200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"aruaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"67N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d8dab10-3571-4f47-a33a-e89ae0c4124b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(奏者に興味がなくて誰も分からなかった)","ts":"1634791911.004700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Njxv="}]},{"client_msg_id":"8295ae8e-7178-4b9a-bc13-a52941f16b91","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"課題曲は全部ショパン作品","ts":"1634790886.004100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EwZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"585e5499-6a22-4b64-bb61-c9c865be2a86","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"(クラシック聴かない人向けに解説すると)ピアノ単独のコンクールとしては最高峰のコンクールです","ts":"1634790851.003700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pq2u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c53c6c7-e3b2-44c0-8637-049c15c2ce9f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"チョピンかと思ってしまった、ショパンかなるほど","ts":"1634790636.002500","team":"T